Key algorithmic details:

- **`Compare`**: collects all replica IDs from both clocks, checks `a[id] <= b[id]` (→ `aLessEq`) and `b[id] <= a[id]` (→ `bLessEq`). The switch on `(aLessEq, bLessEq)` yields the causal ordering.
- **`lwwResolve`**: picks the later wall-clock timestamp; if equal, compares `Clock.String()` lexicographically (sorted IDs provide a total order); if clocks are identical, compares values.
- **`Snapshot`** returns deep copies so mutation is safe.
- All exported methods use `sync.RWMutex` for concurrent safety.

